╭─║ [qsysmin]  host-admin   host-tui                                         ║─╮
│ ║                                                                          ║ │
╰─║ qsysmin is a Go tool that runs as a service on a Linux host and helps    ║─╯
qs║ look after that host. It has the areas Overview, Host, Activity and      ║  
╭─║ Settings.                                                                ║─╮
│ ║                                                                          ║ │
╰─║ Host reads the local users, groups and folder permissions. Changes run   ║─╯
╭─║ through 'sudo qsysmin host ...' after a confirmation, are recorded in a  ║─╮
│ ║ journal with the previous state, and can be undone. Activity shows a log ║ │
│ ║ kept as a hash chain without a signature.                                ║ │
╰─║                                                                          ║─╯
  ║ Admins, members of the group sudo, reach the running service through its ║  
  ║ socket.                                                                  ║  
